  "body": "What changed: three items in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/app_icon.rs` now have `#[cfg(windows)]`. They are `PNG_256`, `taskbar_icon` and the test `the_taskbar_icon_decodes_at_256_and_both_icons_reach_the_window_attributes`. On other targets nothing else becomes unused: `decode_png` is still used by `decode`, and `with_icons` is called from `shell_window.rs` on all targets.\n\nTested: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` on Windows is clean.\n\nNot exercised: the Linux target. The cfg arm was checked by reading the file. The Windows test that is now gated runs only on Windows.\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #1795\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
